# Frontend React

- Vite + React + TypeScript. Not Next.js.
- Graph viz: 3D free force with `react-force-graph-3d` / `three` / `three-spritetext` (`GraphScene.tsx`).
- Talk only to FastAPI (`/api/*`). Never Neo4j Bolt. Never MCP.
- Graph payload: `{ nodes: [{id,label,type,val}], links: [{source,target,type,strength}] }`.
- Chat uses `POST /api/chat/stream` SSE events: `stage | token | sources | graph_context | done`.
- Functional components and hooks. Keep product pages under `frontend/src/pages/` when the UI agent lands.

